Handshake Project

I transformed Handshake’s iconic H into a twisted, bark-covered vampire with a dramatic black cape 
and glowing neon-green accents. 
Surrounded by ghostly spirits, floating bats, and a haunted photocopier, 
the design brings a spooky office atmosphere to life while keeping the original Handshake identity recognizable.

Created using ChatGPT. 🎃
